// art.plm — the accent the album art gives, in the same shape as theme.plm.
//
// The live file is generated: the Cover plugin samples the resolved cover with the
// reference's AccentSampler (the mean of the saturated pixels, two passes) and
// rewrites ~/.config/pleamar/art.plm when the track changes, so an import of it
// re-themes a running scene without a restart.
//
// QS does the same thing in-process: Media.qml samples the cover into a Canvas and
// hands the colour to MusicManager.accentColor, which paints the time's brackets
// and its separator. That is the one place the media capsule is not the theme's.
//
// This copy is the repository's default, so `pleamar --check` runs from the tree.
//
// Roles:
//   cover_accent  MusicManager.accentColor — the cover's mean saturated colour
//               (Theme.accentPrimary until a cover has been sampled).

library Art strict {

    // MusicManager.accentColor's fallback: colors.accent.primary.
    let cover_accent = #006FCC
}
